@page
@model BusinessModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Information for Business";
}

<section class="page-banner">
    <div class="container">
        <h1>Partner with Kasper College: Innovation, Talent &amp; Enterprise Solutions</h1>
        <p>Industry Partnerships, Custom Corporate Training, Consultancy, Graduate Recruitment &amp; Research Collaborations.</p>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section-block" aria-labelledby="biz-intro">
    <div class="container two-col">
        <div>
            <h2 id="biz-intro">1. Executive Introduction &amp; Partnership Philosophy</h2>
            <p>
                At Kasper College, we firmly believe in the transformative power of collaboration between higher education and industry.
                Our college offers a comprehensive ecosystem of enterprise services engineered to accelerate business growth, bridge technical
                skills shortages, and drive forward-looking innovation across computing, cybersecurity, digital media, and product design.
            </p>
            <p>
                Whether you are an established multinational tech enterprise, a scaling regional software company, or an ambitious creative startup,
                Kasper College provides direct access to cutting-edge research facilities, academic thought leadership, and an exceptional pipeline of work-ready talent.
            </p>
        </div>
        <figure class="media-figure">
            <img src="~/images/image6.jpg" alt="Kasper Innovation Hub and enterprise meeting space" />
            <figcaption>Kasper Innovation Hub &amp; Business Incubator on our Sheffield campus.</figcaption>
        </figure>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section-block section-alt" aria-labelledby="biz-services">
    <div class="container">
        <h2 id="biz-services">2. Comprehensive Business &amp; Enterprise Services</h2>
        <div class="grid-cards">
            <article class="card">
                <h3>1. Custom Corporate Training &amp; CPD</h3>
                <p>Upskill and empower your workforce with industry-accredited technical training tailored precisely to your strategic tech stack and organizational needs.</p>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Customizable Modules:</strong> Executive cybersecurity awareness, cloud infrastructure (AWS/Azure), full-stack modern web engineering, data analytics, AI &amp; machine learning deployment, and UI/UX design systems.</li>
                    <li><strong>Flexible Delivery Modes:</strong> On-site corporate masterclasses, evening executive sprints, fully remote online modules, and hybrid blended cohorts.</li>
                    <li><strong>Certification:</strong> Accredited CPD certifications and micro-credentials issued upon module completion.</li>
                </ul>
            </article>

            <article class="card">
                <h3>2. Research &amp; Development (R&amp;D) Collaborations</h3>
                <p>Leverage the expertise of our academic researchers, PhD candidates, and advanced computing laboratories to solve complex engineering challenges and accelerate product development.</p>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Knowledge Transfer Partnerships (KTP):</strong> Government-subsidized partnerships embedding a high-caliber graduate specialist directly inside your business supervised by senior Kasper College faculty.</li>
                    <li><strong>Proof-of-Concept &amp; Prototyping:</strong> Rapid development of minimum viable products (MVPs), hardware prototypes, and algorithmic proofs using our 3D fabrication labs and GPU clusters.</li>
                    <li><strong>Grant Application Assistance:</strong> Collaborative bidding for Innovate UK, EPSRC, and Horizon Europe technical research grants.</li>
                </ul>
            </article>

            <article class="card">
                <h3>3. Design &amp; Technology Consultancy</h3>
                <p>Access impartial, expert technical advice from our faculty specialists and senior industry fellows across diverse domains:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Cybersecurity &amp; Penetration Audits:</strong> Vulnerability assessments, web application penetration tests, ISO 27001 readiness checks, and digital forensics.</li>
                    <li><strong>Software &amp; Cloud Architecture:</strong> Scalability reviews, legacy modernization strategies, database optimization, and microservice transition.</li>
                    <li><strong>User Experience (UX) &amp; Design Systems:</strong> Comprehensive usability audits, user testing laboratories, eye-tracking analytics, and responsive design systems.</li>
                    <li><strong>Product &amp; Spatial Design:</strong> Ergonomic prototyping, interior architecture modeling, and sustainable material specification.</li>
                </ul>
            </article>

            <article class="card">
                <h3>4. Internships, Placements &amp; Graduate Talent Recruitment</h3>
                <p>Connect directly with our motivated, highly skilled student body across undergraduate and postgraduate programmes:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Year-in-Industry Placements:</strong> Hire enthusiastic 3rd-year computing and design undergraduates for 9 to 12-month full-time placements.</li>
                    <li><strong>Summer Internship Programme:</strong> Host 6 to 12-week focused project interns during the summer break.</li>
                    <li><strong>Direct Graduate Hiring Portal:</strong> Zero-fee job posting on the Kasper College Career Hub, reaching hundreds of final-year students and recent alumni.</li>
                    <li><strong>Annual Kasper Tech &amp; Creative Careers Fair:</strong> Showcase your brand and conduct on-the-spot initial interviews at our flagship autumn recruitment expo.</li>
                </ul>
            </article>

            <article class="card">
                <h3>5. Sponsored Capstone Projects &amp; Live Industry Briefs</h3>
                <p>Engage student project teams to solve your non-critical commercial briefs and explore experimental ideas:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Live Client Briefs:</strong> Submit real-world problem statements for module coursework; receive multiple diverse functional prototypes and presentations at term end.</li>
                    <li><strong>Final-Year Honors Projects:</strong> Sponsor individual BEng/BSc dissertation projects tailored to specific research investigations required by your company.</li>
                </ul>
            </article>

            <article class="card">
                <h3>6. Kasper Innovation Hub &amp; Business Incubator</h3>
                <p>Located on the 2nd floor of our campus, the Kasper Innovation Hub supports early-stage digital startups, spin-outs, and tech freelancers:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Facilities:</strong> High-speed gigabit Wi-Fi, flexible hot-desks, private 4-person team suites, bookable conference rooms, and kitchen amenities.</li>
                    <li><strong>Lab Access:</strong> Incubator members gain scheduled access to our 3D prototyping workshops, VR testbeds, and server testing environments.</li>
                    <li><strong>Investor Networking:</strong> Quarterly pitch nights connecting founders with regional angel investors and venture capital syndicates.</li>
                </ul>
            </article>

            <article class="card">
                <h3>7. Conference Facilities &amp; Event Venue Hire</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>300-Seat Lecture Theatre:</strong> Equipped with dual 4K laser projection, live broadcasting, and full stage lighting.</li>
                    <li><strong>Glass Open Atrium:</strong> Ideal for evening networking receptions, trade exhibitions, hackathons, and product launches (capacity up to 450 guests).</li>
                    <li><strong>Executive Boardrooms:</strong> Modern 12 to 24-person meeting suites with integrated Zoom Rooms hardware and gourmet hospitality catering.</li>
                </ul>
            </article>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section-block" aria-labelledby="biz-cases">
    <div class="container">
        <h2 id="biz-cases">3. Industry Success Stories &amp; Case Studies</h2>
        <div class="grid-cards">
            <article class="card">
                <h3>Case Study 1: FinTech Scale-Up (Sheffield Financial Cloud)</h3>
                <p>Partnered via a 12-month Knowledge Transfer Partnership to develop automated fraud detection algorithms using deep learning, resulting in a 42% reduction in false positives and two full-time graduate hires.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="card">
                <h3>Case Study 2: Regional NHS Healthcare Trust</h3>
                <p>Kasper College VR/AR studio faculty and game design students co-developed an interactive immersive training simulator for surgical nursing staff, reducing physical equipment training costs by 65%.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="card">
                <h3>Case Study 3: Global Logistics Provider (Apex Freight Systems)</h3>
                <p>Underwent a comprehensive cybersecurity penetration test and architecture audit by Kasper College cyber specialists, securing critical supply chain endpoints against ransomware threats.</p>
            </article>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

