                <li><strong>Cutting-Edge Expertise:</strong> Our faculty actively conduct applied research and contribute to international standards bodies.</li>
                <li><strong>Proven Talent Pipeline:</strong> Students trained on industry-standard toolsets (Docker, React, Kubernetes, Unity, Figma, AWS, Cisco).</li>
                <li><strong>Bespoke &amp; Agile:</strong> Flexible partnership frameworks tailored to the scale, timelines, and budgets of SMEs through to global enterprises.</li>
                <li><strong>Regional Impact:</strong> Committed to driving economic vitality and technological leadership across South Yorkshire and beyond.</li>
            </ul>
